From 866482c3fe62a43fe46abe6e1fcc8dc271595821 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 15:35:19 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: cup gear is spread over the whole story stretch of
 each cup

A cup now pays the equipment the story gave between the previous cup's boss dungeon and its
own: chests, gifts (Lure Cap) and the rare drops of the stretch's mobs, in story order and at
most two a round. Added: Vambrace (Altin), Turtle Boots and the Hammet Water Jacket moved to
round 2 (Lunpa), and Lure Cap, Lucky Cap, Thunder Crown, Dragon Scales and Gaia Blade (the
Lighthouse). 47 of the 64 reward flags are used. The stretch table is scripts/cupstretch.py;
the table of rewards stays in scripts/cupdata.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
